{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41634","headline":"寄元孚道人 · 陈陶","name":"寄元孚道人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵宇章句客，佩兰三十年。\n长乘碧云马，时策翰林鞭。\n曩事五岳游，金衣曳祥烟。\n高攀桐君手，左倚鸑鷟肩。\n哭玉秋雨中，摘星春风前。\n横輈截洪偃，凭几见广宣。\n尔来寤华胥，石壁孤云眠。\n龙降始得偈，龟老方巢莲。\n内殿无文僧，驱虞谁能牵。\n因之问楚水，吊屈几潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}